    test(orchestrator): accept failing beforeSession

    Acceptance tests for re-cinq/HALEngine#94: a beforeSession that throws
    must run onError and afterSession before the rejection reaches the
    caller. Both fail today because the hook is awaited above the try, so
    the catch and finally never exist on that path. The spec's recorded
    flaw is replaced by the new guarantee, cited from the tests; .lore/dod.md
    holds the definition of done. Red until the await moves inside the try.

    Refs re-cinq/HALEngine#94

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>

